    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/0026b61e5a478efd16282fffce0033b5.webp?t=1730647163\" width=234 height=26 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/8dfa14a14b655f03b7baf0455fd206e3.avif?t=1730647163\" width=616 height=353 /></span><br><br>Club House on Haunted Hill is a story-driven, adventure golf game that blends golf and narrative in the style of a 1960s horror movie. As you play the story you navigate through the haunted lands of the Island of Gallows Neck, each course telling a piece of the overall story.<br><br>In addition to the campaign you will be able to play against friends locally or online on various haunted golf courses. Each hole offers an adventure filled with supernatural elements and horrifying hazards enhancing the challenge. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/63d941b1918fc5b5b3a2f206d377945e.webp?t=1730647163\" width=266 height=27 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/dd34e7f59b332eb93c304795bdd453e8.avif?t=1730647163\" width=616 height=353 /></span><br><br>Distribute points in Muscle, Cunning, Control, Mercy, and Sanity to create the perfect golfer tailored to your play style. You can max out muscle to have the longest drive, or put points in sanity to withstand the psychological terror of golf.<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/10bc50ee181023ea8bc11935d57b101c.webp?t=1730647163\" width=217 height=24 /></span><br><br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/8b7673e10211b37aaf7b2699867681d4.webp?t=1730647163\" width=66 height=16 /></span><br>Cunning enhances your ability to judge distances and predict ball landings. With a sharp cunning of the game you'll be able to anticipate the ball's trajectory and make strategic decisions to outmaneuver your opponents.<br><br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/f735a694c9ed2f25901ec7c1ef1e6a39.webp?t=1730647163\" width=50 height=15 /></span><br>Mercy increases good hit chances, even with off-target hits. Giving you a better chance of landing successful shots, even when your timing isn't perfect.<br><br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/363c951b3f26772f59f93229bdef5a5b.webp?t=1730647163\" width=54 height=15 /></span><br>Sanity improves ball spin and loft control. By mastering this attribute, you can execute complex shots with precision, allowing you to navigate obstacles and fine-tune the ball\u2019s spin.<br><br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/Muscle.png?t=1730647163\" width=54 height=15 /></span><br>Muscle determines how hard you will hit the ball and how far it will travel. This attribute gives you an edge on long fairways and challenging your competitors with powerful shots.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/0026b61e5a478efd16282fffce0033b5.webp?t=1730647163\" width=234 height=26 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/8dfa14a14b655f03b7baf0455fd206e3.avif?t=1730647163\" width=616 height=353 /></span><br><br>Club House on Haunted Hill is a story-driven, adventure golf game that blends golf and narrative in the style of a 1960s horror movie. As you play the story you navigate through the haunted lands of the Island of Gallows Neck, each course telling a piece of the overall story.<br><br>In addition to the campaign you will be able to play against friends locally or online on various haunted golf courses. Each hole offers an adventure filled with supernatural elements and horrifying hazards enhancing the challenge. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/63d941b1918fc5b5b3a2f206d377945e.webp?t=1730647163\" width=266 height=27 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/dd34e7f59b332eb93c304795bdd453e8.avif?t=1730647163\" width=616 height=353 /></span><br><br>Distribute points in Muscle, Cunning, Control, Mercy, and Sanity to create the perfect golfer tailored to your play style. You can max out muscle to have the longest drive, or put points in sanity to withstand the psychological terror of golf.<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/10bc50ee181023ea8bc11935d57b101c.webp?t=1730647163\" width=217 height=24 /></span><br><br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/8b7673e10211b37aaf7b2699867681d4.webp?t=1730647163\" width=66 height=16 /></span><br>Cunning enhances your ability to judge distances and predict ball landings. With a sharp cunning of the game you'll be able to anticipate the ball's trajectory and make strategic decisions to outmaneuver your opponents.<br><br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/f735a694c9ed2f25901ec7c1ef1e6a39.webp?t=1730647163\" width=50 height=15 /></span><br>Mercy increases good hit chances, even with off-target hits. Giving you a better chance of landing successful shots, even when your timing isn't perfect.<br><br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/363c951b3f26772f59f93229bdef5a5b.webp?t=1730647163\" width=54 height=15 /></span><br>Sanity improves ball spin and loft control. By mastering this attribute, you can execute complex shots with precision, allowing you to navigate obstacles and fine-tune the ball\u2019s spin.<br><br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657010/extras/Muscle.png?t=1730647163\" width=54 height=15 /></span><br>Muscle determines how hard you will hit the ball and how far it will travel. This attribute gives you an edge on long fairways and challenging your competitors with powerful shots.",
    "short_description": "Dare to accept the invitation from mysterious millionaire Nicolas Craven and step into the supernatural world of Club House on Haunted Hill. Unravel the game's story in the style of a 1960\u2019s horror film, or challenge your friends, local or online, in a deadly game of golf.",
