        ],
        "notes": "Club House on Haunted Hill draws heavily from classic 1960s horror films, so expect a similar vibe when it comes to mature content. There's no nudity or sexual content in the game. The strongest language you'll hear is along the lines of \"damn\" and \"hell,\" keeping it mild, much like a movie from the 1950s.\r\n\r\nSome characters may be seen smoking or appearing intoxicated. As for violence and gore, it\u2019s presented in a campy, over-the-top style that's more playful than frightening. Think along the lines of exaggerated horror movie effects\u2014blood and gore are there, but it's all in good fun and not meant to be realistic or frightening.\r\n\r\nWe aim for the same experience as old classic horror, without crossing into anything too intense or realistic."
    },
